<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 2cm; }
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: #1a1a1a; }
  .logo { width: 5.2cm; height: auto; }
  .logo-row { display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .logo-mark { width: 1.4cm; }
  .wordmark { font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: middle; margin-left: 0.3cm; }
  .header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; }
  .header .meta { text-align: right; }
  .header .meta h1 { font-size: 18pt; margin: 0 0 0.2em 0; letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
  .header .meta .number { font-size: 11pt; color: #555; margin: 0 0 0.6em 0; }
  .header .meta .dates { font-size: 9pt; color: #555; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }
  .rule { border: none; border-top: 2px solid #1a1a1a; margin: 1.4em 0 0 0; }
  .muted { color: #555; font-size: 9pt; }
  .blocks { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 1.4em; }
  .block { width: 48%; }
  .block h2 { font-size: 8pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #888; margin: 0 0 0.5em 0; }
  .block p { margin: 0; line-height: 1.55; }
  table.lines { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 2.2em; }
  table.lines th { font-size: 8pt; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #888;
                   border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a; padding: 0.5em 0.4em; text-align: left; }
  table.lines td { border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e2e2; padding: 0.7em 0.4em; text-align: left; }
  table.lines th.num, table.lines td.num { text-align: right; }
  table.totals { margin-top: 1.2em; margin-left: auto; width: 45%; border-collapse: collapse; }
  table.totals td { padding: 0.35em 0.4em; }
  table.totals td.num { text-align: right; }
  table.totals tr.grand td { border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a; font-weight: bold; padding-top: 0.5em; }
  .paid-badge { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1.6em; padding: 0.3em 0.9em; border: 1px solid #1a7f4b;
                color: #1a7f4b; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
  .payment { margin-top: 0.6em; }
  .footer { margin-top: 3em; font-size: 7.5pt; color: #777; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; padding-top: 0.6em; line-height: 1.5; }
  .footer p { margin: 0.2em 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <div class="logo-row">
      <svg viewBox="{{ logo_viewbox }}" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="logo{% if wordmark %} logo-mark{% endif %}">{{ logo_paths }}</svg>
      {% if wordmark %}<span class="wordmark">{{ wordmark }}</span>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="meta">
      <h1>INVOICE</h1>
      <p class="number">{{ inv.number }}</p>
      <p class="dates">
        Issue date: {{ inv.issued_at | fmt_date }}<br>
        Payment date: {{ inv.payment_date | fmt_date }}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <hr class="rule">

  <div class="blocks">
    <div class="block">
      <h2>From</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>{{ inv.seller.legal_name }}</strong>{% if inv.seller.trade_name %} ({{ inv.seller.trade_name }}){% endif %}<br>
        {{ inv.seller.address_line1 }}<br>
        {{ inv.seller.postal_code }} {{ inv.seller.city }}, {{ inv.seller.country }}<br>
        VAT: {{ inv.seller.vat_number }}
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="block">
      <h2>Billed to</h2>
      <p>
        {% if inv.buyer.name %}<strong>{{ inv.buyer.name }}</strong><br>{% endif %}
        {% if inv.buyer.address_line1 %}{{ inv.buyer.address_line1 }}<br>{% endif %}
        {% if inv.buyer.address_line2 %}{{ inv.buyer.address_line2 }}<br>{% endif %}
        {% if inv.buyer.postal_code or inv.buyer.city %}{{ inv.buyer.postal_code }} {{ inv.buyer.city }}<br>{% endif %}
        {% if inv.buyer.country %}{{ inv.buyer.country }}<br>{% endif %}
        {% if inv.buyer.vat_number %}VAT: {{ inv.buyer.vat_number }}<br>{% endif %}
        {{ inv.buyer.email }}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <table class="lines">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Description</th>
        <th class="num">Qty</th>
        <th class="num">Unit price (excl. VAT)</th>
        <th class="num">Amount (excl. VAT)</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>
          {{ inv.line_label }}
          {% if inv.period_start and inv.period_end %}
            <br><span class="muted">Service period: {{ inv.period_start | fmt_date }} to {{ inv.period_end | fmt_date }}</span>
          {% endif %}
        </td>
        <td class="num">1</td>
        <td class="num">{{ inv.net_amount | fmt_amount }}</td>
        <td class="num">{{ inv.net_amount | fmt_amount }}</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <table class="totals">
    <tr><td>Subtotal (excl. VAT)</td><td class="num">{{ inv.net_amount | fmt_amount }} {{ inv.currency }}</td></tr>
    {# Currency doubles as the VAT regime (geo.vat_rate_for_currency): EUR = French VAT, anything else = outside scope. #}
    {% if inv.currency == "EUR" %}
      <tr><td>VAT ({{ inv.vat_rate | fmt_pct }}%)</td><td class="num">{{ inv.vat_amount | fmt_amount }} {{ inv.currency }}</td></tr>
    {% else %}
      <tr><td colspan="2" class="muted">TVA non applicable - article 259 B du CGI</td></tr>
    {% endif %}
    <tr class="grand"><td>Total</td><td class="num">{{ inv.gross_amount | fmt_amount }} {{ inv.currency }}</td></tr>
  </table>

  <div>
    <span class="paid-badge">PAID</span>
    <p class="payment muted">Paid on {{ inv.payment_date | fmt_date }} by card (Revolut). No amount due.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <p>{{ inv.seller.legal_name }}{% if inv.seller.trade_name %} ({{ inv.seller.trade_name }}){% endif %} ·
      {{ inv.seller.legal_form }} · {{ inv.seller.rcs }} · SIRET {{ inv.seller.siret }} ·
      {{ inv.seller.address_line1 }}, {{ inv.seller.postal_code }} {{ inv.seller.city }}, {{ inv.seller.country }} ·
      TVA : {{ inv.seller.vat_number }}</p>
    <p>Escompte : néant. En cas de retard de paiement, pénalités au taux de 3 fois le taux d'intérêt légal et
      indemnité forfaitaire pour frais de recouvrement de 40 € (professionnels, art. L441-10 C. com.).</p>
    <p>Catégorie d'opération : Prestation de services.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
